Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.48,Short,,0,0,0,,That pigeon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.48,0:00:01.83,Short,,0,0,0,,isn't bobbing its head
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.83,0:00:02.32,Short,,0,0,0,,Watch
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.69,0:00:03.41,Short,,0,0,0,,With every step
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.41,0:00:04.60,Short,,0,0,0,,its head locks in place
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.60,0:00:05.70,Short,,0,0,0,,frozen in the air
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.70,0:00:06.30,Short,,0,0,0,,while its body
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.30,0:00:06.92,Short,,0,0,0,,walks forward
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:07.58,Short,,0,0,0,,underneath
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.85,0:00:08.20,Short,,0,0,0,,Then the head
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.20,0:00:08.86,Short,,0,0,0,,snaps ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.86,0:00:09.42,Short,,0,0,0,,to catch up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.42,0:00:10.40,Short,,0,0,0,,and locks again
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.65,0:00:11.55,Short,,0,0,0,,Hold, snap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.55,0:00:12.55,Short,,0,0,0,,Hold, snap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.55,0:00:13.21,Short,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.21,0:00:14.14,Short,,0,0,0,,A pigeon can barely
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.14,0:00:14.92,Short,,0,0,0,,move its eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.92,0:00:15.74,Short,,0,0,0,,so it steadies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.74,0:00:16.84,Short,,0,0,0,,its whole head instead
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:17.52,Short,,0,0,0,,like a camera
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.52,0:00:18.52,Short,,0,0,0,,on a tripod
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.90,0:00:19.94,Short,,0,0,0,,Every hold gives it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.94,0:00:21.32,Short,,0,0,0,,a sharp, still picture
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.32,0:00:22.38,Short,,0,0,0,,to spot seeds
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.38,0:00:23.46,Short,,0,0,0,,and hawks
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.76,0:00:24.98,Short,,0,0,0,,Scientists showed it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.98,0:00:25.66,Short,,0,0,0,,with a treadmill
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.66,0:00:26.60,Short,,0,0,0,,When the world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:27.16,Short,,0,0,0,,around the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.16,0:00:27.88,Short,,0,0,0,,walking pigeon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.88,0:00:28.76,Short,,0,0,0,,stopped moving
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:30.22,Short,,0,0,0,,so did the bobbing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.22,0:00:30.88,Short,,0,0,0,,So next time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.88,0:00:32.14,Short,,0,0,0,,one struts past you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.14,0:00:32.80,Short,,0,0,0,,look closely
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.80,0:00:33.50,Short,,0,0,0,,because
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.66,0:00:29.95,Prompt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,250)}Send this to someone\Nwho walks like a pigeon
